    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this stunning, modern 4 bed, 2.5 bath semi-detached family home in pristine condition throughout. Built c.2022 and decorated to a very high standard and upgraded solar & battery system by the current owners. Boasting a sunny south facing landscaped rear garden. The house is very generous in size.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hall with cloakroom and understair storage, guest wc, living room, open plan kitchen / dining room. Upstairs there are 4 good size bedrooms, ensuite and full family bathroom.\n\nLocation is excellent set on the Malahide Road with good public transport links to&from Dublin City Centre. Plus a host of local amenities close by including schools, shops, parks, shops, sports and leisure facilities. Good access to the M1/M50 road network as well as Dublin airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.75m x 3.55m\nLaminate timber effect floor, wall panelling, alarm control panel, under stairs storage, cloakroom.\n\nGuest WC - 1.50m x 1.60m\nWHB, wc, heated towel rail, wall panelling, extractor fan.\n\nLiving Room - 3.80m x 4.40m\nLaminate timber effect floor, wal panelling, box bay window, tv point, recess lights.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 7.25m x 4.10m\nFitted kitchen, stone countertops, island, integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer, dishwasher, laminate timber effect floor, recess lights, french doors to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.00m x 1.75m\nPlumbed for washing machine, space for condenser dryer, counter top, presses.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.00m x 3.70m\nHot press, pull down ladder to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 (Front) - 3.45m x 3.80m\nFitted wardrobes, carpet, tv point.\n\nEnsuite - 2.50m x 1.25m\nWHB, wc, shower, tiled floor, part-tiled walls, heated towel rail, extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 2 (Rear) - 3.45m x 3.35m\nFitted wardrobes, laminate timber effect floor.\n\nBedroom 3 (Front) - 3.70m x 2.45m\nFitted wardrobes, carpet.\n\nBedroom 4 (Rear) - 3.70m x 2.15m\nLaminate timber effect floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.65m x 1.40m\nWHB, wc, separate shower, tiled floor, part tiled walls, heated towel rail, extractor fan.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nPaved driveway, flowerbeds, gated side entrance.\n\nRear Garden - \nSouth facing, walled, lawn, paved patio, shed, landscaped flower beds.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Upgraded high output solar panels and battery.</li><li>Air-To-Water Heat pump.</li><li>Double glazed windows.</li><li>Mechinical Ventilation System.</li><li>South facing landscaped rear garden.</li><li>Private off street parking for 2 cars.</li><li>Showhouse condition throughout.</li><li>Approx. 125sqm / 1,345sqft.</li><li>No management fees.</ul>"
      },
